  "text": {
    "status": "generated",
    "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n  <h2>Dyslipidemia, All</h2>\n  <p>This value set contains terms related to dyslipidemia. It includes conditions where total cholesterol and/or triglycerides are high, low-density lipoprotein is low, and a variety of associated disorders (e.g., xanthomatosis). It includes primary, secondary, and familial/genetic lipid disorders as well as various manifestations of dyslipidemia.</p>\n  <p>Contains 321 concept(s) from 3 code system(s).</p>\n</div>"
